# Fonts

## Active font: Estedad only
- Config: `src/lib/fonts.ts` via `next/font/local`
- Files: `public/assets/fonts/estedad/`
  - `Estedad-Regular.ttf` (400)
  - `Estedad-Medium.ttf` (500)
  - `Estedad-SemiBold.ttf` (600)
  - `Estedad-Bold.ttf` (700)
- CSS variable: `--font-estedad`; applied on `<html>` in root layout

## Do not
- Re-add Noto Nastaliq Urdu, icomoon, or unused Estedad weights
- Load fonts from Google Fonts CDN in production code
- Change font paths without updating `fonts.ts` and keeping all 4 weights

## Setup (fresh clone / missing files)
1. Download Estedad from [rastikerdar/estedad](https://github.com/rastikerdar/estedad)
2. Copy the four TTF files into `public/assets/fonts/estedad/`
3. Restart: `npm run dev` — no code changes if filenames match `fonts.ts`

## Adding/replacing fonts
1. Place TTF/WOFF2 under `public/assets/fonts/<name>/`
2. Register in `src/lib/fonts.ts` with `localFont`
3. Wire `variable` on root layout; use Tailwind/CSS var if needed
4. Restart dev server after file changes
